--- !u!114 &1251870687
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1251870685}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7b5af63ecc4fdca4d943bc59468f9a67, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DeliveryMissionDatabase
  missions:
  - missionName: Standard Delivery
    description: 'Rewards: +10 Stars  +5 Coins'
    flavorTexts:
    - The customer is already waiting...
    - Just another day in the city:)
    - A hungry pigeon can't pay rent:(
    - Someone ordered absolutely nothing urgent.
    - A package. A destination. No pressure.
    - Business as usual. Probably.
    - Another satisfied customer awaits:)
    modifier: 0
    coinMultiplier: 1
    timerMultiplier: 1
    throttleMultiplier: 1
    reputationReward: 10
    coinReward: 5
    oneHitFail: 0
  - missionName: Express Delivery
    description: 'Rewards: +15 Stars  +10 Coins

      -Less time available'
    flavorTexts:
    - Fast! Ana needs her mail.
    - 'Last seen: "Where is my package?"'
    - Express delivery means EXPRESS.
    - The customer keeps refreshing the tracking page.
    - Your reputation is on the line.
    - Someone paid extra for speed.
    - A very impatient customer is waiting.
    modifier: 1
    coinMultiplier: 1
    timerMultiplier: 0.75
    throttleMultiplier: 1.3
    reputationReward: 15
    coinReward: 10
    oneHitFail: 0
  - missionName: Fragile Package
    description: 'Rewards: +20 Stars  +15 Coins

      -Package breaks on first hit'
    flavorTexts:
    - Definitely not a vase.
    - Please don't drop grandma's cookies.
    - Handle with care. Seriously.
    - One bump and it's over.
    - The customer bought insurance. You didn't.
    - Glass. Lots of glass.
    - This package contains 12 eggs.
    modifier: 2
    coinMultiplier: 1
    timerMultiplier: 1
    throttleMultiplier: 1
    reputationReward: 20
    coinReward: 15
    oneHitFail: 1
  - missionName: Heavy Package
    description: 'Rewards: +15 Stars  +10 Coins

      -Reduced speed'
    flavorTexts:
    - Who ships bricks by pigeon?
    - This package feels suspiciously dense.
    - Leg day for pigeons.
    - A sofa would weigh less.
    - You may regret accepting this one.
    - Nobody knows what's inside.
    - Try not to stall mid-air.
    modifier: 3
    coinMultiplier: 1
    timerMultiplier: 1.2
    throttleMultiplier: 0.75
    reputationReward: 15
    coinReward: 10
    oneHitFail: 0
